<title>HONG KONG: No plan to cut Shanghai Ind stake - parent.</title>
<headline>No plan to cut Shanghai Ind stake - parent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Industrial Investment (Holdings) Co Ltd has no plan to lower its 65.1 percent stake in its Hong Kong-listed arm, Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd, a company spokesman told Reuters on Monday.</p>
</text>
